  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mid Term Review of the Administrative Management of Denmark&apos;s Peace and Stabilisation Response 2023-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the purpose of this contribution ia to support a midterm review of Denmark&#x2019;s Deployment Facility for Peace and Democracy (DFPD) in order to ensure relevant, efficient and timely deployment of qualified Danish civilian advisors and election observers to international missions to respectively support crisis management and election processes in fragile and developing countries. The purpose of the review is twofold: First, to assess the impact of Danish deployments via the DFPD to international missions, and second, to review how NIRAS A/S administer said DFPD-deployments.</narrative>
  </description>
